    "created_at": "2023-09-18T09:26:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-18T09:28:11Z",
    "body": "Thank you for surfacing this issue @dbaron! See also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3330#issuecomment-1703002862 for more background as to why we want to preserve the Telephone special case after all.\r\n\r\nI think Telephone is already covered using your first suggestion:\r\n\r\n```css\r\n[dir]:dir(ltr), bdi:dir(ltr), input[type=tel i]:dir(ltr) { direction: ltr; }\r\n```\r\n\r\nor would some further change be warranted?\r\n\r\n(I suspect https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9689 is not impacted here as that would influence `:dir` which would end up doing the right thing.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
